{"section":{"id":1009,"title":"第二个十年（前三九〇—前三八一年）","book_id":1},"paragraphs":[{"seq":0,"kind":"text","text":"战国时代","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":1,"kind":"text","text":"公元前四世纪","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":2,"kind":"text","text":"◎田姓家族正式篡夺齐国政权","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":3,"kind":"text","text":"◎吴起被诬陷，畏罪，奔楚。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":4,"kind":"text","text":"◎秦国政变，杀出公。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":5,"kind":"text","text":"◎吴起死。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":6,"kind":"text","text":"◎高卢王布雷那斯，率七万大军进攻罗马共和国，纵火焚罗马城，罗马赔偿黄金一千磅赎城。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":7,"kind":"text","text":"◎罗马大将卡密鲁斯反攻，大败高卢军，斩布雷那斯。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":8,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三九〇年辛卯","by_year":-390,"file":null},{"seq":9,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":10,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":11,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":12,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":13,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦惠公十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":14,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩烈侯十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":15,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":16,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵武侯十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":17,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":18,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":19,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":20,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公二十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":21,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":22,"kind":"text","text":"1秦国（首府雍县〔陕西省凤翔县〕）和晋国（首府新田〔山西省侯马市〕）在武城（陕西省渭南市华州区东）会战。（晋国〔首府新田〕自被瓜分后，连本身生存都有问题，已无力作任何战争。可能是和魏国〔首府安邑·山西省夏县〕，或韩国〔首府平阳·山西省临汾市〕会战。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":23,"kind":"text","text":"2齐国（首府临淄〔山东省淄博市东临淄区〕）攻击魏国，陷襄陵（河南省睢县）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":24,"kind":"text","text":"3鲁国（首府曲阜〔山东省曲阜市〕）在平陆（山东省汶上县西北）击败齐国军队。（平陆在鲁国首府曲阜西北航空距离五十千米，齐国军队竟在那里吃败仗，说明那是一支侵略部队。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":25,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八九年壬辰","by_year":-389,"file":null},{"seq":26,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":27,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐太公二十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":28,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":29,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":30,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦惠公十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":31,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":32,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":33,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩烈侯十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":34,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":35,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵武侯十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":36,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":37,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":38,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":39,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公二十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":40,"kind":"text","text":"1秦国（首府雍县〔陕西省凤翔县〕）攻击晋国（首府新田〔山西省侯马市〕。晋国此时已无地可供攻击，可能仍是魏国〔首府安邑·山西省夏县〕或韩国〔首府平阳·山西省临汾市〕之误）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":41,"kind":"text","text":"2齐国（首府临淄〔山东省淄博市东临淄区〕）国务官（大夫）田和，跟魏国国君（一任）魏斯，楚王国（首都郢都〔湖北省江陵县〕）及卫国（首府濮阳〔河南省濮阳市〕）的特别使节，在浊泽（河南省新郑市西南），举行高阶层会议，田和请他们帮助，使他在名义上取得国君的头衔。魏国国君魏斯，即向周王国国王（三十九任安王）姬骄，代田和请求封爵，姬骄欣然同意。史称田和为田姓齐国的太公。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":42,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八八年癸巳","by_year":-388,"file":null},{"seq":43,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":44,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐太公二十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":45,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":46,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":47,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦惠公十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":48,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":49,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":50,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩烈侯十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":51,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":52,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵武侯十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":53,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":54,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":55,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":56,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公二十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":57,"kind":"text","text":"1*田姓齐国（首府临淄〔山东省淄博市东临淄区〕）太公田和，本年（前三八八年）逝世，子田剡（第二任）继位。（原记载只因遗漏田剡一代，遂发生一连串错误。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":58,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八七年甲午","by_year":-387,"file":null},{"seq":59,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":60,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡元年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":61,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":62,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":63,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦惠公十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":64,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":65,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":66,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩烈侯十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":67,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":68,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵武侯十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":69,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":70,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":71,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":72,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公二十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":73,"kind":"text","text":"1秦国（首府雍县〔陕西省凤翔县〕）大军南下，侵入蜀国（首府成都〔四川省成都市〕）领土，占领北部重镇南郑（陕西省汉中市）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":74,"kind":"text","text":"2魏国（首府安邑〔山西省夏县〕）国君（一任文侯）魏斯逝世，子魏击嗣位（二任），是为武侯。（此项记载有误。参考前三九七年。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":75,"kind":"text","text":"魏击在西河（潼关以北的黄河）乘坐御舟，顺流而下，水势奔腾，峭壁夹岸，行到中游，神采焕发，对大将吴起说：“多么美丽的锦绣江山啊，固若金汤，这是我们魏国的至宝！”吴起说：“我不认为地理形势有什么重要，国家的安危，在领导人的品德，不在山川的险阻。从前三苗部落，左面有洞庭湖，右面有鄱阳湖，可以说万无一失，但因为领导人堕落不振，夏王朝开国君王（一任帝）姒文命，把他们消灭。夏王朝末代君王（十九任）姒履癸（桀），首都也在安邑（山西省夏县），东有黄河、济水（古黄河支流，流经河南、山东两省，大部分河道今已湮没），西有华山（陕西省华阴市南），南有伊阙（河南省洛阳市南），北有羊肠阪（山西省平顺县东南太行山中，顾名思义，道路好像羊肠，易守难攻）。可是政治腐败，商王朝开国君王（一任）子天乙，把他赶下宝座，放逐远方。等到商王朝末代君王（三十一任）子受辛（纣），西边是孟门（山西省吉县西），东边是太行山，北方有恒山（河北省曲阳县北），南方有黄河，可是他暴虐无道，周王朝开国君王（一任）姬发，把他诛杀。由此看来，国家的安危，在领导人的品德，不在山川的险阻。如果主上不为国家尽责，恐怕现在跟主上同船的亲信，到时候一个个都成了敌国。”魏击懔然说：“我谨记你的话。”","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":76,"kind":"text","text":"魏击任命田文担任宰相。吴起不高兴，对田文说：“我想跟你讨论一下你我对于国家的贡献，你以为如何？”田文说：“当然可以。”吴起说：“指挥武装部队，官兵们愿意牺牲性命，使敌国惊惧，不敢打我们的主意，你比我怎么样？”田文说：“我不如你。”吴起说：“使政府的功能充分发挥，使全国人民安居乐业、国库充实、社会富庶，你比我怎么样？”田文说：“我不如你。”吴起说：“防卫西河（潼关以北的黄河），秦国不敢向东侵略。而韩国（首府平阳〔山西省临汾市〕）与赵国（首府晋阳〔山西省太原市〕），不敢不对我们唯命是听，你比我怎么样？”田文说：“我不如你。”吴起说：“这三项重要大事，你都不如我，可是官位却比我高，那为什么？”田文说：“当君王年纪还小，有权势的重要官员互相猜忌，随时可能发动政变，民心恐慌。这个时候，宰相位置，应该属于你，还是属于我？”吴起沉默很久，抱歉说：“我承认，应该属于你。”","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":77,"kind":"boyang_mark","text":"柏杨曰：","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":78,"kind":"boyang","text":"当政治的运转有一定的秩序，人们也习惯并接受这种秩序时，压根不会产生“主少国疑，大臣未附，百姓不信”的危机。只有腐烂的政权，在转移时才有这种特殊现象。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":79,"kind":"boyang","text":"若干时日后，魏国宰相公叔（魏国可能设立一个以上的宰相，也可能此时田文已去位或逝世），妻子是魏国公主，公叔权倾中外，忌妒吴起的超凡才能，认为终有一天，吴起会威胁到他的职位，因而想把吴起排除，可是一时想不出妥善方法。他的一个绝顶聪明的仆人建议说：“排除吴起，易如反掌。他这个人最大的缺点是过度刚强，而且对自己的心直口快，颇为满意。所以，只要设计一个圈套，就不怕他不跳进去。你先报告国君说：‘吴起是一位了不起的英雄。可是，我们魏国是个小国，恐怕留不住他。留住他的唯一方法，只有许配给他一位公主，使他成为魏国的女婿。如果他志不在魏国，非投奔其他大国不可，必定拒绝这项婚姻。’然后，你在家里设宴，邀请吴起跟你同时回府，而跟公主先行商议妥当，使公主做出对你百般侮辱的动作，你也做出对这种侮辱的百般忍受的动作。吴起发现公主那么凶悍，不把平民出身的丈夫当成人，一定不敢娶她的妹妹，好了，这就跳进陷阱。”公叔大喜过望，按照计划进行。吴起果然心惊胆战，向魏击表示无福消受金枝玉叶，魏击霎时间简直不敢相信自己的耳朵。吴起这才发觉他中了暗箭，然而为时已迟，无法挽救，恐怕魏击翻脸无情，把他杀掉，于是逃亡，投奔楚王国（首都郢都〔湖北省江陵县〕）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":80,"kind":"boyang","text":"楚王（十七任悼王）芈疑，早就敬慕吴起的贤能，遂即任命他当宰相。吴起就职后，雷厉风行，推动一项广泛的改革运动，制定合乎时代的法律，并建立法律的尊严，罢黜所有只领薪水却不工作的闲散官员，撤销血统疏远的一些皇族们的爵位俸禄，加强训练军队，提高军队的战斗力，坚持独立的外交政策，反对跟秦国和解。在吴起强烈的革新运动下，楚王国陡地强大。数年之间，疆土扩张到百越（东南沿海的浙江省、福建省及广东省），北方阻止三晋——赵国、韩国、魏国的南侵，西方数度攻击秦国。各国对楚王国的迅速复兴，大为忧虑。可是，在楚王国内部，那些因改革而失势的贵族和既得利益阶层，对吴起却十分仇视。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":81,"kind":"boyang","text":"3秦国国君（二十二任）惠公（名不详）逝世，子出公（名不详）继位（二十三任）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":82,"kind":"boyang","text":"4赵国国君（二任）武侯（名不详）逝世，贵族再拥护一任君（烈侯）赵籍的儿子赵章继位（三任），是为敬侯。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":83,"kind":"boyang","text":"5韩国国君（二任烈侯）韩取逝世，子文侯（名不详）继位（三任）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":84,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八六年乙未","by_year":-386,"file":null},{"seq":85,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":86,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":87,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":88,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":89,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦出公元年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":90,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":91,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":92,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯元年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":93,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":94,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯元年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":95,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":96,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":97,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":98,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公二十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":99,"kind":"text","text":"1周王国（首都洛阳〔河南省洛阳市白马寺东〕）国王（三十九任安王）姬骄，下令擢升齐国（首府临淄〔山东省淄博市东临淄区〕）国务官（大夫）田和，当齐国国君。（早在前三八九年，已经下令擢升，且本年田和已死，此项记载有误。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":100,"kind":"text","text":"2赵国（首府晋阳〔山西省太原市〕）贵族（公子）赵朝作乱，投奔魏国（首府安邑〔山西省夏县〕），在魏国协助下，攻击赵国新迁入的首府邯郸（河北省邯郸市），失败。（本年〔前三八六年〕，赵国首府自晋阳迁邯郸，赵朝当是利用迁府之际，发动政变。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":101,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八五年丙申","by_year":-385,"file":null},{"seq":102,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":103,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":104,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":105,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":106,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦出公二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":107,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":108,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":109,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":110,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":111,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":112,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":113,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":114,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":115,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公三十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":116,"kind":"text","text":"1秦国（首府雍县〔陕西省凤翔县〕）庶长（秦官第十、十一级）改（姓不详），发动政变，逮捕国君（二十三任）出公（名不详）跟他的娘亲，沉到河里淹死。迎接流亡河西（甘肃省中部）的贵族嬴师隰回国继位（二十四任），是为献公。（这是一件复仇公案。二十九年前的前四一五年，二十任国君灵公嬴肃逝世，嬴肃的叔父嬴悼子夺得政权，继位二十一任国君，是为简公。嬴肃的儿子嬴师隰受到生命威胁，逃亡到河西。前四〇〇年，嬴悼子逝世，子惠公〔名不详〕继位〔二十二任〕。前三八七年，惠公逝世，子出公〔名不详〕继位，直到本年。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":117,"kind":"text","text":"2田姓齐国（首府临淄〔山东省淄博市东临淄区〕）攻击鲁国（首府曲阜〔山东省曲阜市〕）。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":118,"kind":"text","text":"3韩国（首府平阳〔山西省临汾市〕）攻击郑国（首府新郑〔河南省新郑市〕），占领阳城（河南省登封市告成镇），又进攻宋国（首府睢阳〔河南省商丘市〕），俘虏宋国国君（三十二任休公）宋田。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":119,"kind":"text","text":"田姓齐国（首府临淄）国君（一任太公）田和逝世，子田午继位（三任），是为桓公。（田午非田和子，而是田和孙。田和生田剡〔二任〕，田剡于前三八八年继位，前三七八年逝世，子田午才继位，此项记载有误。）","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":120,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八四年丁酉","by_year":-384,"file":null},{"seq":121,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":122,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":123,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":124,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":125,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦献公元年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":126,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":127,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":128,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":129,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":130,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":131,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":132,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":133,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公二十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":134,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公三十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":135,"kind":"text","text":"1本年无记载。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":136,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八三年戊戌","by_year":-383,"file":null},{"seq":137,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":138,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":139,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":140,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":141,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦献公二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":142,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":143,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":144,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":145,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":146,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":147,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":148,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":149,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公二十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":150,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公三十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":151,"kind":"text","text":"1魏国（首府安邑〔山西省夏县〕）攻击赵国（首府邯郸〔河北省邯郸市〕），在兔台（今地不详）大败赵军。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":152,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八二年己亥","by_year":-382,"file":null},{"seq":153,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":154,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":155,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十八年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":156,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":157,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦献公三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":158,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":159,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":160,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":161,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":162,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":163,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王二十年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":164,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公二十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":165,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公二十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":166,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公三十三年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":167,"kind":"text","text":"1日全食。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":168,"kind":"year","text":"公元前三八一年庚子","by_year":-381,"file":null},{"seq":169,"kind":"ruler","text":"周安王二十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":170,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐田剡七年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":171,"kind":"ruler","text":"鲁穆公二十九年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":172,"kind":"ruler","text":"晋孝公十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":173,"kind":"ruler","text":"秦献公四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":174,"kind":"ruler","text":"魏武侯十六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":175,"kind":"ruler","text":"郑康公十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":176,"kind":"ruler","text":"韩文侯六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":177,"kind":"ruler","text":"宋休公十五年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":178,"kind":"ruler","text":"赵敬侯六年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":179,"kind":"ruler","text":"楚悼王二十一年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":180,"kind":"ruler","text":"燕僖公二十二年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":181,"kind":"ruler","text":"齐康公二十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":182,"kind":"ruler","text":"卫慎公三十四年","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":183,"kind":"text","text":"1楚王国（首都郢都〔湖北省江陵县〕）国王（十七任悼王）芈疑逝世，因吴起厉行政治革新而丧失既得利益的皇亲国戚，乘丧暴动，追杀吴起。吴起逃到灵堂，趴在芈疑尸体的旁边。暴徒们乱箭齐发，射死吴起，但同时也射中芈疑的尸体。下葬既毕，子芈臧即位（十八任），是为肃王，下令宰相（令尹）逮捕作乱的暴徒，屠杀七十余家。","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":184,"kind":"boyang_mark","text":"柏杨曰：","by_year":null,"file":null},{"seq":185,"kind":"boyang","text":"吴起何负于鲁国？被疑逃亡。何负于魏国？又被疑逃亡。何负于楚王国？更遭杀身之祸。吴起的遭遇，正是一个封建社会中，心直口快，胸无城府，却既有能力而又正直的知识分子的悲剧。杀妻求将，从此后再没有人抓这个小辫子，可证明只不过是政客们所使用的一种斗臭手段。鲁国在他手中不再受侵略，魏国在他手中强大，衰老的楚王国在他手中得到重生。忠心耿耿，才干之高，历史上很难找到匹敌，竟不容于当世，不禁为吴起悲，也为那些国家悲。伏到国王尸体之旁，能在死后复仇，这种智谋，也无人可及。如果有一个国家能对他始终重用，历史可能重写。","by_year":null,"file":null}],"highlights":[]}